  "description": "One of the most capable rides in the Revel line up, the El Jefe. Ready for damn near any ride you put in front of it, the El Jefe is fast, light, and mighty capable for long missions in the backcountry. While maintaining its playful abilities on all types of terrain.\n\nConfidently take the Jefe bikepacking, over technical singletrack, and to the start line of your next XC race. A straight top tube, room for 29×2.6” tires with ample mud clearance. Sliding dropouts with 420-435mm chain stay adjustability allows you to build this up just how you like it. Load it up for adventure or keep it lightweight and fast.\n\nJefe Branham is an ultra-endurance legend based in Gunnison, CO, and the namesake for this special Revel. Jefe gave us the blueprints of his dream bike for going fast in the backcountry and together we turned it into a reality.",
